    .string "兑换了一辆自行车。$"

CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_ThankYouComeAgain::
    .string "谢谢！\n"
    .string "欢迎下次光临！$"

CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_HowDoYouLikeNewBicycle::
    .string "你喜欢你的新自行车吗？\n"
