CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_BikesCoolButExpensive::
    .string "这些自行车太酷了，\n"
    .string "但是它们都很贵！$"

CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_WowYourBikeIsCool::
    .string "哇。\n"
